## Acceptance criteria

- Smaller following head and visible tapered trail; no disconnected dot approximation.
- Tail geometry bounded to eight links; Pause freezes it, stopping merges it into head.
- Website-matching container widths and empty side gutters at all checked viewports.
- Exact pattern bytes, no external artwork, and no text/control blur.
- No added image-tool views or inferred owner acceptance.

